/**
@dir mqbevt

@brief The `MQBEVT` (BlazingMQ Broker Events) package provides broker
dispatcher event types.

The `mqbevt` package provides implementations of the `mqbi::DispatcherEvent`
interface, one for each type of event dispatched within the broker, such as
PUT, PUSH, ACK, CONFIRM, REJECT, and STORAGE events.
*/
